OL,5,G0100 My Top Twelve: Cass Elliot
OL,6,     FIn a programme recorded just
OL,7,     Ftwelve days before she died, Cass
OL,8,     FElliot of The Mamas and The Papas
OL,9,     Ftalks to Brian Matthew about her
OL,10,     Fcareer and favourite records.
OL,11,G0200 My Top Twelve: Joni Mitchell
OL,12,     FJoni Mitchell joins host Andy
OL,13,     FPeebles to share a playlist of 12
OL,14,     Fdefining tracks, discussing how
OL,15,     Fartists from Miles Davis to Edith
OL,16,     FPiaf shaped her music.
